<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <title><%= siteName %> - Privacy Policy</title>

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/authentication/privacy.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" />
</head>

<body>
  <canvas id="backgroundCanvas"></canvas>

  <main class="privacy-page">
    <header class="privacy-hero">
      <a href="/" class="logo-section" aria-label="Go to ARNI home">
        <img src="/images/common/logo.png" alt="<%= siteName %> Logo" />
      </a>

      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy & Data</p>
      <h1><%= siteName %> Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        Learn how we collect, use, protect, and manage your personal information while you shop with us.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="privacy-content">
      <article class="section">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-circle-info"></i>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
          <p>
            At <%= siteName %>, we take your privacy seriously. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect,
            use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website and make purchases.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="section">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-database"></i>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>

          <h3>2.1 Personal Information</h3>
          <p>We collect information that you voluntarily provide, including:</p>

          <ul>
            <li>Name and contact information</li>
            <li>Billing and shipping addresses</li>
            <li>Payment information</li>
            <li>Email address</li>
            <li>Phone number</li>
            <li>Account login credentials</li>
          </ul>

          <h3>2.2 Automatically Collected Information</h3>
          <p>When you visit our website, we automatically collect:</p>

          <ul>
            <li>IP address</li>
            <li>Browser type</li>
            <li>Device information</li>
            <li>Cookies and usage data</li>
            <li>Shopping behavior and preferences</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="section">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-gears"></i>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>We use the collected information for:</p>

          <ul>
            <li>Processing and fulfilling orders</li>
            <li>Communicating about your orders</li>
            <li>Sending marketing communications with your consent</li>
            <li>Improving our website and services</li>
            <li>Preventing fraud and maintaining security</li>
            <li>Complying with legal obligations</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="section">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-share-nodes"></i>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>4. Information Sharing</h2>
          <p>We may share your information with:</p>

          <ul>
            <li>Payment processors and shipping partners</li>
            <li>Service providers who assist our operations</li>
            <li>Legal authorities when required by law</li>
          </ul>

          <p>We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="section">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-shield-halved"></i>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
          <p>We implement appropriate security measures to protect your information, including:</p>

          <ul>
            <li>Encryption of sensitive data</li>
            <li>Secure socket layer SSL technology</li>
            <li>Regular security assessments</li>
            <li>Limited access to personal information</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="section">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-user-check"></i>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
          <p>You have the right to:</p>

          <ul>
            <li>Access your personal information</li>
            <li>Correct inaccurate information</li>
            <li>Request deletion of your information</li>
            <li>Opt out of marketing communications</li>
            <li>Lodge a complaint with supervisory authorities</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="section">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-cookie-bite"></i>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>7. Cookies Policy</h2>
          <p>
            We use cookies to improve your browsing experience. You can control cookie settings through
            your browser preferences.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="section">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-child"></i>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
          <p>
            Our services are not intended for children under <%= minAge %>. We do not knowingly collect
            information from children under <%= minAge %>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="section">
        <div class="section-icon">
          <i class="fas fa-pen-to-square"></i>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>9. Changes to Privacy Policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. We will notify you of any material changes
            through our website or email.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <section class="contact-info">
        <p class="contact-title">For privacy-related inquiries, contact our Data Protection Officer:</p>

        <div class="contact-grid">
          <p>
            <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i>
            <span>Email:</span>
            <a href="mailto:<%= privacyEmail %>"><%= privacyEmail %></a>
          </p>

          <p>
            <i class="fas fa-location-dot"></i>
            <span>Address:</span>
            <strong><%= companyAddress %></strong>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: <%= lastUpdated %></p>

      <div class="page-actions">
        <a href="/auth/signin" class="btn-secondary">
          <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i>
          Back to Sign Up
        </a>

        <a href="/" class="btn-primary">
          <i class="fas fa-house"></i>
          Go Home
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script src="/javascripts/authentication/privacy.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
